#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:5
#: 3773162f4e3c4d22870bd220883adf18
msgid "TeraVolt AeroTel 2.4 - Telemetry Radio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:7
#: fefc23425c47444aaef899d9b40d7339
msgid "The **AeroTel 2.4** by **TeraVolt Labs** is a professional, plug-and-play telemetry module powered by the industry-proven **DroneBridge** communication core."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:9
#: ad0d77b8925a41f388a568a6d357663e
msgid "While standard DroneBridge boards require manual wiring and soldering, the AeroTel 2.4 is engineered specifically for ArduPilot integration. It features a custom \"mounting-friendly\" PCB, pre-installed JST-GH connectors matching the Pixhawk standard, and dedicated onboard controls for mode switching."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:16
#: 6b890706194e4aa080745ba5e0bb4ea3
msgid "Key Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:18
#: 1cfe708add714da2b8dbb20752ce35ab
msgid "**Plug & Play:** Pre-installed JST-GH 6-pin connector (Direct fit for Pixhawk/Cube TELEM ports)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:19
#: 501b9a3f7adc4f23be9c466bf60056c6
msgid "**Hardware Mode Button:** Dedicated button to cycle between WiFi AP, WiFi Client, and ESP-NOW Long Range modes (no web interface required)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:20
#: 7f2373226b9940c4a377f7f51ea75ed3
msgid "**Smart Status LED:** Onboard multi-color LED provides instant visual feedback on connection status and operating mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:21
#: 115c8202102e4f65847d2890881acf3d
msgid "**OTA Firmware Updates:** Native support for wireless firmware updates via WiFi."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:22
#: e90f905756c34aab814c78f5d1e527bd
msgid "**Mounting Friendly:** Custom form factor with standard M3 mounting holes for secure chassis installation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:23
#: e8e304326c464e058b130d9127a01a72
msgid "**Security:** AES-256 encryption for secure data links."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:26
#: 3501a0f8c99a4f928849204b0e7958fc
msgid "Specifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-AeroTel-24.rst:28
